  "title": "Lightly Spiced Vietnamese Chicken Tagine",
  "description": "A funky and creamy Vietnamese dish made with chicken, white flour, and Mediterranean spices, cooked in a traditional clay tagine vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
